{
  "format_version": 1,
  "description": "The maintainer's rig as the physical board gate runs it: each port's steps in order, with the board tool arguments that rig needs, and the probehive runtime and bitstream it uses. gate.py replaces {probehive}, {ram_loader} and each name of a port's location in an argument; a location left null is not set up, and the gate ends that port needs-setup before any hardware.",
